WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:13.320
And then here come a man through the community saying that a refinery . . . He was looking at everything and he said,

2
00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:19.600
"Y'all could be rich here if you just had the money to put up oil fields."

3
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:29.860
And he say, "Anywhere you see marshy land with lot of pine cones and pine trees, you have lots of oil."

4
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.680
I remember it was in the ’40s.

5
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.900
Now around here the refineries kill all our stuff.
